<cem:description lang="en">This lesson: "Big Decisions" belongs to Intermediate (B1.3). It is composed of twelve learning objects, that have the following learning outcomes: identify ways of improving aspects of communication in English based on the learning outcomes for level Intermediate A; accurately use information about people’s backgrounds in a wider variety of communicative situations. On the other hand, the communicative functions of this lesson are: explain your opinions; organize points in an argument; use expressions like of course and in fact; explain your opinions; show you understand someone’s feelings or situation; organize points in an argument.</cem:description>
